        <rdfs:label>Commons Quantities and Units Ontology</rdfs:label>
        <skos:changeNote>The https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/20230801/QuantitiesAndUnits.rdf version of this ontology was modified to loosen functional constraints on a number of properties, which caused reasoning errors when these generic properties were reused with multiple subproperties on the same concept and eliminate potentially circular restrictions (Commons-1.2-5) and to add the concept of a measurement reference to enable better alignment of such references with quantity values whose reference is something other than a unit of measure (Commons-1.2-3).</skos:changeNote>
